  "description": "The PUBLIC D8i Alfine Disc LTD is a true workhorse—one of our most functional and performance-oriented bikes yet.\nCrafted from high-quality, lightweight Chromoly steel, it’s strong, durable, and delivers a smooth, comfortable ride. The Shimano Alfine 8-speed hub offers a wide gear range and a quiet, virtually maintenance-free experience, while Shimano hydraulic disc brakes provide confident, responsive stopping in any weather.\nRiders will appreciate the Premium Sport Saddle, designed to deliver the comfort and performance of a well-worn leather saddle from day one, along with a threadless headset, weatherproof grips, and sleek, minimalist mirrored decals.\nBuilt to endure the long haul, the D8i Alfine Disc LTD features our strongest double-wall wheelset with color-matching rims and puncture-resistant tires. Alloy fenders and a chainguard help keep you clean and dry in all conditions.\nCombining performance and urban practicality, the PUBLIC D8i Alfine Disc LTD is ready for nearly any style of riding—and guaranteed to turn heads wherever you go.",
